        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.183,
                0.109,
                0.812,
                0.15
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 35: 已知  \\( f(t) \\)  为系统的输入,  \\( y(t) \\)  为系统的输出, 试判断下列系统是否为线性、时不变系统。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.396,
                0.156,
                0.601,
                0.191
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\frac {d y (t)}{d t} + a (t) y (t) = \\frac {d f (t)}{d t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.543,
                0.546,
                0.561
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "考点3：线性时不变系统的特性与应用"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.571,
                0.595,
                0.587
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、LTIS的线性性质—系统(零状态)响应与外加激励",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.596,
                0.811,
                0.636
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "对于线性系统而言，当系统外加激励发生线性变化时，其对应的(零状态)响应发生相同形式的变化。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.645,
                0.237,
                0.66
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例如：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.451,
                0.667,
                0.546,
                0.692
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf (t) \\stackrel {H} {\\to} y (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.698,
                0.211,
                0.713
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "则",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.413,
                0.721,
                0.577,
                0.745
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n2 f _ {1} (t) + 3 f _ {2} (t) \\xrightarrow {H}?\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.751,
                0.415,
                0.768
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "故答案应为 \\(2y_{1}(t) + 3y_{2}(t)\\)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.159,
                0.882,
                0.373,
                0.898
            ],
