        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.157,
                0.056,
                0.363,
                0.072
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "B站up: 信号与系统_谷哥",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.634,
                0.056,
                0.837,
                0.072
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.11,
                0.363,
                0.125
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、LTIS的时不变性质"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.134,
                0.811,
                0.175
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "对于时不变系统而言，当系统外加激励发生移位变化时，其对应的(零状态)响应发生相同移位变化。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.184,
                0.237,
                0.199
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例如：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.451,
                0.206,
                0.546,
                0.231
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf (t) \\stackrel {H} {\\to} y (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.236,
                0.21,
                0.252
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "则",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.442,
                0.26,
                0.547,
                0.283
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf (t - 2) \\stackrel {H} {\\rightarrow}?\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.29,
                0.345,
                0.306
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "故答案应为 \\( y(t - 2) \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.33,
                0.313,
                0.665,
                0.338
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n2 f _ {1} (t) + 3 f _ {2} (t - 2) \\xrightarrow {H} 2 y _ {1} (t) + 3 y _ {2} (t - 2)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.366,
                0.364,
                0.381
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3、LTIS的微积分性质"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.39,
                0.81,
                0.439
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "对于LTI系统满足如下的微分特性:若系统在激励 \\( e(t) \\) 作用下产生响应 \\( r(t) \\) ，则当激励为 \\( \\frac{de(t)}{dt} \\) 时，响应为 \\( \\frac{dr(t)}{dt} \\) 。根据线性与时不变性容易证明此结论。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.184,
                0.445,
                0.811,
                0.516
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "首先由时不变特性可知，激励 \\( e(t) \\) 对应输出 \\( r(t) \\) ，则激励 \\( e(t-\\Delta t) \\) 产生响应 \\( r(t-\\Delta t) \\) 。再由叠加性与均匀性可知，若激励为 \\( \\frac{e(t)-e(t-\\Delta t)}{\\Delta t} \\) 则响应等于 \\( \\frac{r(t)-r(t-\\Delta t)}{\\Delta t} \\) ，取 \\( t\\to0 \\) 的极限，得到导数关系。若激励为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.377,
                0.523,
                0.618,
                0.556
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\lim _ {\\Delta t \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {e (t) - e (t - \\Delta t)}{\\Delta t} = \\frac {d}{d t} e (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.561,
                0.263,
                0.576
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "则响应为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.379,
                0.584,
                0.617,
                0.617
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\lim _ {\\Delta t \\to 0} \\frac {r (t) - r (t - \\Delta t)}{\\Delta t} = \\frac {d}{d t} r (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.622,
                0.811,
                0.663
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "这表明，当系统的输入由原激励信号改为其导数时，输出也由原响应函数变成其导数。显然，此结论可扩展至高阶导数与积分。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
